WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.729 --> 00:00:15.595
<v><b>Taxi Company:</b></v> Good afternoon. Thank you for calling Express Taxis.

2
00:00:15.727 --> 00:00:20.647
To book a taxi, press one. For customer service, press two.

3
00:00:24.029 --> 00:00:27.214
<v><b>Taxi Company:</b></v> Hello. Express Taxis. How can I help?

4
00:00:27.346 --> 00:00:31.717
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Hello. Can I book a taxi from one hundred and nine The Strand, please?

5
00:00:40.854 --> 00:00:43.117
<v><b>Taxi Company:</b></v> Of course. Where to?

6
00:00:43.402 --> 00:00:44.940
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Victoria Station.

7
00:00:51.946 --> 00:00:54.319
<v><b>Taxi Company:</b></v> Train station or coach station?

8
00:00:54.319 --> 00:00:55.768
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Train station.

9
00:01:02.885 --> 00:01:04.993
<v><b>Taxi Company:</b></v> And when would you like it for?

10
00:01:05.169 --> 00:01:06.641
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> As soon as possible.

11
00:01:14.065 --> 00:01:17.360
<v><b>Taxi Company:</b></v> OK. About ten minutes?

12
00:01:17.645 --> 00:01:19.754
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thanks. How much is it?

13
00:01:27.068 --> 00:01:28.957
<v><b>Taxi Company:</b></v> That’s fourteen pounds.

14
00:01:29.111 --> 00:01:30.582
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Can I pay by card?

15
00:01:37.743 --> 00:01:39.324
<v><b>Taxi Company:</b></v> Yes, of course.

16
00:01:39.324 --> 00:01:41.103
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Perfect. Thank you.

17
00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:49.208
<v><b>Ticket Clerk:</b></v> Can I help?

18
00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.184
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes, can I have a ticket to Gatwick Airport?

19
00:01:59.883 --> 00:02:02.080
As soon as possible, please?

20
00:02:08.559 --> 00:02:12.359
<v><b>Ticket Clerk:</b></v> No problem, the next train is at seventeen fifteen.

21
00:02:12.469 --> 00:02:14.665
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> OK, that’s fine.

22
00:02:21.079 --> 00:02:23.122
<v><b>Ticket Clerk:</b></v> Single or return?

23
00:02:23.539 --> 00:02:24.879
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Er…single.

24
00:02:31.468 --> 00:02:34.829
<v><b>Ticket Clerk:</b></v> That’s eighteen pounds fifty. Cash or card?

25
00:02:34.939 --> 00:02:36.498
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Card, please.

26
00:02:43.066 --> 00:02:44.801
<v><b>Ticket Clerk:</b></v> Do you need a receipt?

27
00:02:44.801 --> 00:02:46.931
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No, thank you.

28
00:02:53.543 --> 00:02:55.871
Which platform is it?

29
00:03:02.768 --> 00:03:04.393
<v><b>Ticket Clerk:</b></v> Platform thirteen.

30
00:03:04.393 --> 00:03:05.579
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thanks.